````php
$newContext = $router->getContext()->withScheme('https')->withHost('acme.example.com');
$url = $router
    ->getUrlGenerator()
    ->withContext($newContext)
    ->generate('my_route', [], UrlGeneratorInterface::ABSOLUTE_URL)
;
```

An other solution could be to add an argument to the `UrlGeneratorInterface::generate()` and `Route::generate()` methods but it will imply to add it using a comment to avoid BC breaks.

