 * `RequestContext::runWith()` takes the values as named arguments, in the same order as the constructor. `null` means unchanged, while `''` and `[]` still clear the query string and the parameters.
 * `Messenger`'s `RouterContextMiddleware` now uses it and loses 34 lines. It was the in-tree proof that this primitive was missing.

